
# game/script.rpy:62
translate english start_a1a37220:

    # e "Sveiks, topošais Jūrniek! {image=emoji/wave.png} Redzams, ka esi ieradies laikā."
    e "Ahoy, future sailor! {image=emoji/wave.png} I see you've arrived right on time."

# game/script.rpy:66
translate english start_b52fcce7:

    # e "Esmu kapteinis Oto - šī kuģa lepns vadītājs. Un šodien... nu, šodien mums būs neliels piedzīvojums!"
    e "I'm Captain Oto — the proud master of this ship. And today... well, today we're in for a little adventure!"

# game/script.rpy:67
translate english start_e40cd9fb:

    # e "Virpirms gan vēlos ar Tevi iepazīties! Kā Tevi sauc?"
    e "But first, I'd like to get to know you! What's your name?"

# game/script.rpy:72
translate english start_30e06b45:

    # e "Cerams [name] muļķības nesarakstīja {image=emoji/sweat.png}. Jebkurā gadījumā - spēles laikā ievadītā informācija no tās ārpus neizkļūs. Tā kā droši vari izpausties!"
    e "Hopefully [name] didn't type in something silly {image=emoji/sweat.png}. Either way — anything you enter here stays in the game. So feel free to express yourself!"

# game/script.rpy:76
translate english start_e9d0c367:

    # e "Šodien Tu dosies man līdzi uz vienu no modernākajiem kuģiem Eiropā - \"{color=#ff8335}BALTIJAS PĒRLE{/color}\". Mēs to šeit saucam par Pērli."
    e "Today you'll join me aboard one of the most modern ships in Europe — \"{color=#ff8335}BALTIC PEARL{/color}.\" Around here, we simply call her the Pearl."

# game/script.rpy:77
translate english start_97ad596d:

    # e "Tā tiek uzskatīta par tehnoloģisko brīnumu - aprīkota ar jaunākajām automatizācijas, navigācijas un komunikāciju sistēmām."
    e "She's considered a technological marvel — equipped with the latest automation, navigation, and communication systems."

# game/script.rpy:78
translate english start_f9f18a27:

    # e "Vismaz tā to reklamē apkārt. Raksta: \"{i}kuģis nepārspējams drošībā{/i}\". Bet... vai tiešām?"
    e "At least, that's how they advertise her im the news. They say: \"{i}a ship unmatched in safety{/i}.\" But… is she really?"

# game/script.rpy:82
translate english start_3ce8afef:

    # e "Redzi - kiberdrošība pamazām kļūst par vienu no aktuālākajiem jūrniecības izaicinājumiem. Un diemžēl - arī par visvājāko punktu gana daudzos kuģos."
    e "You see — cybersecurity is quickly becoming one of the biggest challenges in the maritime world. And unfortunately, it's also the weakest link on many ships."

# game/script.rpy:86
translate english start_3f2a855d:

    # e "Vadības, navigācijas, kartēšanas, dzinēju sistēmas un tīkli, arī apkalpes ierīces - itin visam ir savas ievainojamības. Mūs ieskaitot!"
    e "Control, navigation, charting, engine systems, networks — even crew devices — everything has its vulnerabilities. Us included!"

# game/script.rpy:87
translate english start_a643e807:

    # e "Tieši tā - mēs runājam par {u}kiberdrošību{/u}. Šodienas kuģi ir kā peldoši datu centri. Un diemžēl arī kārdinošs mērķis uzbrucējiem, kas vien gaida izdevību ielauzties pa kādu digitālo \"lūku\"."
    e "That's right — we're talking about {u}cybersecurity{/u}. Today's ships are like floating data centers. And unfortunately, a tempting target for attackers waiting to slip in through a digital \"hatch.\""

# game/script.rpy:88
translate english start_15cf7260:

    # e "Vispirms gan vēlos, lai pats novērtē savas priekšzināšanas kiberdrošībā! Brīvi atbildi skalā no 1 līdz 10, kur 1 ir nekā nezinītis, bet 10 - drīzāk kapteinim pamācīs kas un kā."
    e "First, I'd like you to rate your own knowledge of cybersecurity! Answer freely on a scale from 1 to 10, where 1 means complete beginner, and 10 means you could probably teach the captain a thing or two."

# game/script.rpy:93
translate english start_18679818:

    # e "Cerams spēles gaitā iegūsi jaunas zināšanas un nostiprināsi esošās. Ā, un ja domā, ka absolūti neko nezini - būsi pārsteigts, cik daudz ko jau zinam, vien neapzinamies. Drīz redzēsi!"
    e "I hope during the game you'll gain new knowledge and strengthen what you already know. And if you think you know nothing at all — you'll be surprised at how much you actually do without even realizing it! You'll see soon enough."

# game/script.rpy:97
translate english start_e4fe97f5:

    # e "Tu piedalīsies mācību programmā - simulācijā, kas ļaus Tev iziet cauri dažādiem kiberdrošības scenārijiem un uzdevumiem, kuri vairumā balstīti uz reāliem piemēriem."
    e "You'll take part in a training program - a simulation that lets you go through various cybersecurity scenarios and challenges, most of them based on real-life cases."

# game/script.rpy:98
translate english start_82889fa9:

    # e "Es to saucu par \"{color=#ff8335}Sea Safe{/color}\" tūri."
    e "I call it the \"{color=#ff8335}Sea Safe{/color}\" tour."

# game/script.rpy:102
translate english start_e6dcbe77:

    # e "Tavā uzdevumā - iziet 3 spēles daļas, iejusties dažādās lomās, analizēt situācijas, pieņemt lēmumus un saprast, kāpēc kiberdrošība nav tikai IT cilvēku lieta."
    e "Your task — complete 3 parts of the game, take on different roles, analyze situations, make decisions, and understand why cybersecurity isn't just an IT issue."

# game/script.rpy:103
translate english start_dee29b2c:

    # e "Iesaku daļas iziet pēc kārtas - secīgi varēsi iepazīties ar terminiem."
    e "I recommend playing the parts in order — you'll get to know the terms step by step."

# game/script.rpy:104
translate english start_7c2f9c79:

    # e "Došu arī punktus, taču tos vien beigās uzzināsi! Vēlos, lai par tiem pārāk nedomā un atbildi tā, kā pats labāk domā."
    e "I'll also be giving you points, but you'll only see your total at the end! I don't want you to overthink it — just answer how you truly feel."

# game/script.rpy:106
translate english start_57637825:

    # e "Un noteikti nebaidies kļūdīties - mēs te esam, lai mācītos un pārbaudītu paši {u}sevi{/u}. Kļūdīšanās ir daļa mācīšanās procesa!"
    e "And don't be afraid to make mistakes — we're here to learn and test {u}ourselves{/u}. Mistakes are part of the learning process!"

# game/script.rpy:108
translate english start_f96eb6f5:

    # e "Ja kaut ko būsi palaidis garām, iepriekšējo tekstu var apskatīt sadaļā \"Vēsture\"."
    e "If you miss something, you can always review the text in the \"History\" section."

# game/script.rpy:112
translate english start_b2fdfea9:

    # e "Nu, tad saki, vai gatavs kāpt uz Pērles?"
    e "So then — are you ready to step aboard the Pearl?"

# game/script.rpy:121
translate english start_acde0bcf:

    # e "-2 punkti"
    e "-2 points"

# game/script.rpy:125
translate english start_54038a2c:

    # e "Ha! Noticēji? Jokus pie malas - ejam!"
    e "Ha! Fell for it? Jokes aside — let's go!"

# game/script.rpy:141
translate english end_d5b87ab1:

    # e "Vairs Tevi nemocīšu - šodienai pietiks!"
    e "I won't keep you any longer — that's enough for today!"

# game/script.rpy:142
translate english end_5efb201f:

    # e "Kopā pa visām daļām esi ieguvis [points] punktus no 25 punktiem!"
    e "Across all parts, you've scored [points] out of 25 points!"

# game/script.rpy:146
translate english end_54d9e16c:

    # e "Cepuri nost! Gaidu, kad nāksi mācīt mani! {image=emoji/clap.png}"
    e "Hats off! I'll be waiting for the day you come to teach me! {image=emoji/clap.png}"

# game/script.rpy:150
translate english end_326d5c1f:

    # e "Ļoti labi! Izskatās, ka ar kiberdrošību esi kā uz Tu!"
    e "Very good! Looks like you and cybersecurity are on friendly terms!"

# game/script.rpy:153
translate english end_00def11d:

    # e "Labs rezultāts, bet ir kur vēl tiekties!"
    e "Good result, but there's still room to grow!"

# game/script.rpy:156
translate english end_5253b1a9:

    # "Būtu jāatkārto kāda daļa. Ir kur vēl tiekties!"
    "You might want to replay a section. There's still room for improvement!"

# game/script.rpy:159
translate english end_288adc66:

    # e "Atceries - kiberdrošība sākas nevis ar sistēmām, bet ar cilvēku - Tevi!"
    e "Remember — cybersecurity doesn't start with systems, it starts with people — with You!"

# game/script.rpy:160
translate english end_0fbc2f7c:

    # e "Spēles gaitā varējām novērot, ka pat vismodernākais kuģis var nebūt drošs, ja to vājina cilvēks, kurš neapzinās kiberriskus."
    e "As we've seen, even the most advanced ship isn't safe if weakened by a crew member unaware of cyber risks."

# game/script.rpy:161
translate english end_0d5f6bd0:

    # e "Tu esi pirmais aizsardzības līnijas posms. Tavas izvēles, gan virtuālās, gan reālās, ietekmē visu kuģa drošību."
    e "You are the first line of defense. Your choices — both virtual and real — impact the safety of the entire ship."

# game/script.rpy:162
translate english end_241dc5d3:

    # e "Ja kaut daļu no šeit redzētā aiznesīsi sev līdzi uz īstu kuģi, darba vidi vai ikdienas ierīcēm, tad mans mērķis būs izpildījies."
    e "If you carry even a part of what you've seen here into a real ship, your workplace, or your daily devices, then my mission is complete."

# game/script.rpy:164
translate english end_10bc43f9:

    # e "Un, kas zin - varbūt tieši Tu nākotnē būsi tas, kurš palīdzēs novērst īstu incidentu. Apsveicu ar \"{color=#ff8335}Sea Safe{/color}\" tūres iziešanu!"
    e "And who knows — maybe one day you'll be the one to prevent a real incident. Congratulations on completing the \"{color=#ff8335}Sea Safe{/color}\" tour!"

# game/script.rpy:166
translate english end_b73b3475:

    # e "Liels paldies par Tavu iesaisti! Lai Tev droši ceļi - gan jūrā, gan kibertelpā."
    e "Thank you so much for your participation! May your journeys be safe — both at sea and in cyberspace."

# game/script.rpy:169
translate english end_846d4502:

    # e "{i}Bon voyage!{/i}"
    e "{i}Bon voyage!{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:173
translate english end_ede1ced2:

    # e "Pirms pavisam atvadāmies, man Tev ir viens neliels lūgums."
    e "Before we say goodbye, I have one small request."

# game/script.rpy:174
translate english end_374af937:

    # e "Lai novērtētu un uzlabotu šo spēli un tās saturu, nepieciešams veltīt pāris minūtes un aizpildīt īsu aptauju. Tā ir anonīma un aizņems mazāk nekā 2 minūtes."
    e "To help evaluate and improve this game and its content, please take a couple of minutes to fill out a short survey. It's anonymous and takes less than 2 minutes."

# game/script.rpy:175
translate english end_8390f606:

    # e "Spied šeit, lai atvērtu aptauju: {color=#ff8335}{a=https://forms.gle/Qx4wbVYcDxNAFRRm8}Spēles aptauja{/a}{/color}"
    e "Click here to open the survey: {color=#ff8335}{a=https://forms.gle/Qx4wbVYcDxNAFRRm8}Game survey{/a}{/color}"

# game/script.rpy:177
translate english end_e8a4df50:

    # e "Paldies!"
    e "Thank you!"

